        "second-content": {
            "data1": "Atul Bijawat is a seasoned business leader with nearly two decades of experience in the field of Sales, Marketing, Operations, P&L Management, and Consulting in multiple industrial domains of EVs, Software, Construction & Building Materials, and Telecom.",
